 is unable to maintain Susi, a ballerina reduced to teaching dance to overweight women, and Lucilla, their quiet and imaginative six-year- old daughter who suffers from severe bronchial asthma. They are helped economically by Pierpaolo, Luca’s seventeen-year-old son from a previous relationship. Pierpaolo lives in an Art Nouveau house with his mother and grandfather, an important trial lawyer of cases linked to politics who rakes in several million euros a year. In the setting of a magnificent and incomprehensible Rome, both a good mother and a bad one, Mary Ann, a deeply Catholic student of art history from Ireland, au pair for the little Lucilla, is caught in the middle."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aWqrMRiA4bez1qfLtB5rewB9rfi.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mTFHNa561KNAt3b6l8xKIIV1giy.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}},"tmdb:inventory-v2:series":{"originalLanguage":"it-IT","images":{"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aWqrMRiA4bez1qfLtB5rewB9rfi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aWqrMRiA4bez1qfLtB5rewB9rfi.jpg","language":"it","width":1707,"height":2560},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yBqwc5rjAI1FvXJR0zfAh20Zeuj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yBqwc5rjAI1FvXJR0zfAh20Zeuj.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c596g57DNY8pBFFH7MQybEHJTPm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c596g57DNY8pBFFH7MQybEHJTPm.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3jWOmBIK6QLZakR3131sqVHtkA8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3jWOmBIK6QLZakR3131sqVHtkA8.jpg","language":"it","width":1911,"height":2560}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mTFHNa561KNAt3b6l8xKIIV1giy.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.